  m_text: '<size=40><color=#22D3EE>UI DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT</color></size>

    Muhammad
    Hamza

    CS464 - Lab 7 (Mobile UI System)


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>DESIGN
    & ARCHITECTURE</color></size>

    10-Screen Mobile Navigation Flow

    Flat
    Block-Style UI System


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>TYPOGRAPHY</color></size>

    Heading:
    Exo 2 by Google Fonts

    Body: Inter by Google Fonts


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>ICONS
    & AUDIO</color></size>

    Procedural vector block icons (SpriteFactory.cs)

    Synthesised
    UI audio (AudioHub.cs)

    Zero external image dependencies


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>TOOLS</color></size>

    Unity
    6

    TextMeshPro

    Unity uGUI


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>SPECIAL THANKS</color></size>

    Instructor:
    Muhammad Raza Butt



    <size=52><b>THANK YOU</b></size>'
